[0.004022, "o", "\r\n[\u001b[33mWARNING\u001b[39m]: Console output during zsh initialization detected.\r\n\r\nWhen using Powerlevel10k with instant prompt, console output during zsh\r\ninitialization may indicate issues.\r\n\r\nYou can:\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000019, "o", "  - \u001b[1mRecommended\u001b[0m: Change \u001b[1m~/.zshrc\u001b[0m so that it does not perform console I/O\r\n    after the instant prompt preamble. See the link below for details.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000081, "o", "    * You \u001b[1mwill not\u001b[0m see this error message again.\r\n    * Zsh will start \u001b[1mquickly\u001b[0m and prompt will update \u001b[1msmoothly\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000041, "o", "  - Suppress this warning either by running \u001b[1mp10k configure\u001b[0m or by manually\r\n    defining the following parameter:\r\n"]
[0.000031, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000015, "o", "      \u001b[33mtypeset\u001b[39m -g POWERLEVEL9K_INSTANT_PROMPT=quiet\r\n"]
[0.000009, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000006, "o", "    * You \u001b[1mwill not\u001b[0m see this error message again.\r\n"]
[0.000062, "o", "    * Zsh will start \u001b[1mquickly\u001b[0m but prompt will \u001b[1mjump down\u001b[0m after initialization.\r\n\r\n  - Disable instant prompt either by running \u001b[1mp10k configure\u001b[0m or by manually\r\n"]
[0.000009, "o", "    defining the following parameter:\r\n"]
[0.000034, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000041, "o", "      \u001b[33mtypeset\u001b[39m -g POWERLEVEL9K_INSTANT_PROMPT=off\r\n"]
[0.000023, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000004, "o", "    * You \u001b[1mwill not\u001b[0m see this error message again.\r\n"]
[0.000032, "o", "    * Zsh will start \u001b[1mslowly\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n  - Do nothing.\r\n"]
[0.000017, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000015, "o", "    * You \u001b[1mwill\u001b[0m see this error message every time you start zsh.\r\n"]
[0.000033, "o", "    * Zsh will start \u001b[1mquickly\u001b[0m but prompt will \u001b[1mjump down\u001b[0m after initialization.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000021, "o", "For details, see:\r\n"]
[0.000043, "o", "\u001b]8;;https://github.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k#instant-prompt\u0007https://github.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k#instant-prompt\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000038, "o", "\u001b[33m-- console output produced during zsh initialization follows --\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n"]
